Check my publications at [DBLP](https://dblp.uni-trier.de/pers/hd/j/Junior:Heleno_de_S=_Campos), [Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=3BsQ-6oAAAAJ) and [Research Gate](https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Heleno_De_Souza_Campos_Junior). Most of my publications are available on-line in these sites, but feel free to contact me if you want any of my papers that you could not find on-line.
